  "text": {
    "intro": "The Marchmont Mutual Improvement Society has taken on the case of the missing trowel with a seriousness it has never shown a book.\nFive investigators are involved. Determine each investigator's start time, theory and alibi.\n- **Investigator**: Leopold, Ngozi, Ariadne, Hortensia and Immaculata.\n- **Start time** (listed from earlier to later): 8am, 9am, 10am, 11am and noon.\n- **Theory**: the postman, nothing happened at all, a clerical error, an inside job and a magpie.\n- **Alibi**: watching the snooker, a long bath, the dentist, no alibi whatsoever and a locked greenhouse.\nEvery investigator has a different start time, theory and alibi, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "The following two do NOT both hold; either one alone may hold, and so may neither: (a) Hortensia and noon are exactly one hour apart in start time order, in one direction or the other. (b) Ngozi does not report at 10am.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) The investigator who favours nothing happened at all reports at 9am. (b) The investigator who claims a locked greenhouse does not favour a magpie.",
      "The investigator who favours an inside job falls somewhere between Ngozi and noon in start time order.",
      "The investigator who favours an inside job does not report at 11am.",
      "Ariadne and 10am are exactly two hours apart in start time order.",
      "The investigator who favours a magpie is later than 9am in start time order.",
      "One of the investigator who claims a long bath and Hortensia sits at an odd-numbered start time and the other at an even-numbered start time.",
      "The investigator who favours a clerical error is exactly one hour earlier than Leopold, with no start time in between.",
      "The investigator who favours a magpie is earlier than the investigator who claims watching the snooker in start time order.",
      "The investigator who favours a magpie is earlier than the investigator who claims no alibi whatsoever in start time order.",
      "The investigator who claims no alibi whatsoever falls somewhere between Ngozi and the investigator who favours nothing happened at all in start time order."
    ]
  }
